			"Message": "fix(Output): Enforce font fallback and mandatory API injection in webviews\n\nRefine the `Logging` transform plugin in Output to resolve critical rendering and initialization failures in WKWebView environments:\n\n1. **CSP Font Fallback**: Replace the hardcoded `font-src *` append logic with a regex-based insertion (`/(font-srcs+)([^;]+)/`) within the `Inject.Webview.Debug.Logging` handler. This ensures the wildcard fallback is correctly appended to existing `font-src` directives without duplicating values, fixing silent font blocking for KaTeX and Codicons.\n\n2. **Mandatory API Injection**: Decouple the `_vscodeApiScript` injection from the `options.allowScripts` flag. The transform now unconditionally injects the API script (wrapped in a `try-catch`) to ensure extensions like Roo Code can initialize `acquireVsCodeApi` even when script execution is restricted, while still logging the state transition.\n\nAdditionally, standardize whitespace in `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to match the project's formatting guidelines.\n\nThese changes restore full extension functionality and consistent font rendering across all supported webview backends.",
			"SHA": "3df0a74050b39a9774112895ca98d38893743b3a"
		},
